MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Smart Plug feels like a useful next purchase because it could let my existing Echo devices control a compatible lamp, adding something my setup does not already do.",
    "The Show 8's larger screen, Echo Auto's car use, and Echo Flex's compact design each offer a possible new use for Alexa, although I would need a clear need and suitable compatibility before choosing them."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The streaming sticks duplicate my recently purchased Fire TV Stick 4K Max bundle, so their familiar features give me little reason to buy another.",
    "The older Show 5 and Dot feel unnecessary after my newer versions, especially since I just added a stand for my Show 5. The tablet also lacks a clear purpose in my current setup."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My recent Echo and Fire TV purchases seem to have been taken as interest in almost any Amazon device, when I care about what each device would actually add.",
    "Having bought a speaker or streaming device seems to be treated as a reason to buy more devices with the same function, even when the suggested version is older than mine."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My recent purchases already satisfy several needs; the Show 5 stand suggests I am continuing to use that display rather than looking to replace it immediately.",
    "My history includes accessories, adapters, and replacement batteries that support equipment I already own. A useful addition with clear compatibility can matter more to me than another complete device."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognize my interest in Alexa but miss that I currently need useful additions to my setup more than duplicate or older devices."
}
